\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Rise up, O men of God !
\par Have done with lesser things;
\par Give heart and soul and mind and strength
\par To serve the King of Kings.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Rise up, O men of God !
\par His kingdom tarries long;
\par Bring in the day of brotherhood,
\par And end the night of wrong.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Rise up, O men of God !
\par The Church for you doth wait,
\par Her strength unequal to her task;
\par Rise up and make her great.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lift high the Cross of Christ !
\par Tread where His feet have trod;
\par As brothers of the Son of Man
\par Rise up, O men of God !\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

